{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Polygon War</strong> is a <strong>strategy</strong>, <strong>idle</strong>\u00a0and <strong>roguelike</strong> game. You choose a <strong>turret</strong>, select a <strong>weapon</strong>, and dive into a series of increasingly difficult enemy waves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The turret <strong>fires automatically</strong>, allowing you to focus on resource management. Spend the coins earned from each wave wisely in the in-game shop to survive the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game currently features <strong>sixteen</strong>\u00a0<strong>turrets</strong> with <strong>different abilities and stats</strong>, along with <strong>seventeen</strong>\u00a0<strong>unique bullets</strong> and <strong>six challenging difficulty modes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you think you can survive the most rounds in Infinite Mode on the highest difficulty, give it a try. If you fall short, the <strong>record system</strong> will track the highest difficulty you've beaten and the most rounds completed.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3793840?t=1753654797","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/8bf6e32092a80dc343d42b2743192df9c7a269f8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753654797","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/1d1ada38291fa48dbb6f858c35a44c01ec52e4f0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753654797","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3793840/1d1ada38291fa48dbb6f858c35a44c01ec52e4f0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753654797","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3850060,"description":""}],"det